<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mening saytim</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        h1 {
            color: blue;
            font-size: 40px;
        }

        p {
            color: green;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        button {
            background-color: black;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Salom Dunyo!</h1>

    <p>Bu mening birinchi CSS sahifam.</p>

    <button>Bosish</button>

</body>
</html>

